---
import Layout from '../../layouts/Layout.astro'
---

<Layout 
  title="DSE Exam Strategy | Free Paper Structure & Time Management"
  description="Complete DSE exam strategy guide with paper structure and time management. Free download for DSE students."
>
  <section class="hero">
    <h1>DSE<br><span>Exam Strategy</span></h1>
    <p>Paper structure and time management. Maximize your DSE score with proven strategies.</p>
  </section>

  <section>
    <h2>Paper Structure</h2>
    <div class="formula-grid">
      <div class="formula-card">
        <h3>Compulsory Part</h3>
        <pre><code>• Section A&#58; Multiple choice
• Section B&#58; Short questions
• Section C&#58; Long questions
• Time&#58; 2.5 - 3 hours
• Marks&#58; 100% of grade</code></pre>
      </div>
      <div class="formula-card">
        <h3>Extended Part (if applicable)</h3>
        <pre><code>• Module 1/2/3 options
• More in-depth questions
• Higher difficulty
• Additional marks</code></pre>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section>
    <h2>Time Management</h2>
    <div class="formula-grid">
      <div class="formula-card">
        <h3>Timing Strategy</h3>
        <pre><code>• Section A&#58; 30-40 minutes
• Section B&#58; 60-70 minutes
• Section C&#58; 60-80 minutes
• Review&#58; 10-15 minutes

1 mark ≈ 1-1.5 minutes</code></pre>
      </div>
      <div class="formula-card">
        <h3>Question Approach</h3>
        <pre><code>• Read all questions first
• Start with easier questions
• Mark difficult questions
• Return to difficult questions
• Don't spend too long on one question</code></pre>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section>
    <h2>Answering Techniques</h2>
    <div class="formula-grid">
      <div class="formula-card">
        <h3>Multiple Choice</h3>
        <pre><code>• Read question carefully
• Eliminate wrong answers
• Watch for "NOT" or "EXCEPT"
• Check units
• Guess if unsure (no penalty)</code></pre>
      </div>
      <div class="formula-card">
        <h3>Structured Questions</h3>
        <pre><code>• Show all working
• Use correct units
• Answer what is asked
• Use proper terminology
• Write in full sentences</code></pre>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section>
    <h2>Download</h2>
    <p>Print this page or save as PDF for quick reference.</p>
    <p><strong>Tip:</strong> Use Ctrl+P (Cmd+P on Mac) to print or save as PDF.</p>
  </section>
</Layout>
